         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nIn the previous class, we learned that there is a recipe for division, which we call long division. However, we studied it with small numbers, so we did not need to continue dividing after the first step. In other words, our long division was short.\n\nIn this class, we will make the name more meaningful by extending the method to larger numbers.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
