         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Step by Step\n\nThere is no barrier to dividing a number larger than 50 by 5. The main difference from what we learned in previous classes is the need to perform more steps. For example, see the division of 320 by 5:",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"extended-division-recipe-320-5\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "c924d397-9582-4acc-9692-bef3b93e1d30",
         "prev": "b3a77007-c7f5-46e9-ad84-a0822a7f7acf",
