               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned that when numbers are larger than the values in a multiplication table, we can still use the long division method to reach the result. The recipe is the same; we simply repeat its steps as many times as needed.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
